{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2021-12-08 08:36:00', 'title': 'COMMUNITY AND REGIONAL BANKS EMBRACE DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION BY SELECTING FIS', 'text': 'JACKSONVILLE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AS COMMUNITY AND REGIONAL BANKS ACCELERATE THEIR DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION STRATEGIES, FIS® (NYSE: FIS) CONTINUES TO BE A DESTINATION FOR INNOVATIVE FINANCIAL INSTITUTIONS LOOKING FOR PROVIDERS WITH A FULL FINANCIAL SUITE OF SOLUTIONS. FIS HAS RECENTLY SIGNED AGREEMENTS WITH FIVE NEW BANKS, INCLUDING POINTBANK AND BANK OF SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA, WHO ARE EMBRACING HORIZON AND DIGITAL ONE AS THEIR BANKING AND DIGITAL PLATFORMS FOR THE FUTURE. BASED IN DENTON, TX, LO'}